#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Adrenaline Pump"
msgstr "Pompa Adrenaliny"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Adrenaline Pump'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A stimulator system has been surgically implanted alongside your adrenal "
"glands, allowing you to trigger your body's adrenaline response at the cost "
"of some bionic power."
msgstr ""
"System stymulujący został chirurgicznie wszczepiony przy twoich gruczołach "
"adrenalinowych, pozwalając odpalić reakcję adrenalinową twego ciała kosztem "
"części mocy bionicznej."

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Active Defense System"
msgstr "Aktywny System Obronny"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Active Defense System'}
#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Active Defense System CBM'}
#: data/json/bionics.json data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This bionic charges a forcefield around your body that deflects incoming "
"attacks.  Bullets are heavily deflected, piercing well deflected, slashing "
"moderately deflected and bashing barely deflected.  This bionic charges at "
"half speed for 3 turns after being hit, and doesn't consume power when fully"
" charged."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Thermofluidic Propulsion Modules"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Thermofluidic Propulsion Modules'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"These advanced propulsion modules utilize thermofluidic principles to "
"generate lift and controlled thrust, allowing the user to achieve limited "
"levitation and short-range flight.  When toggled on, they emit directed "
"thermal energy through micro-thrusters to maneuver over obstacles or "
"hazardous terrain.  Energy is consumed both during activation and sustained "
"operation."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Alarm System"
msgstr "System Alarmowy"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Alarm System'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A motion-detecting alarm system will notice almost all movement within a "
"fifteen-foot radius, and will silently alert you.  This is very useful "
"during sleep, or if you suspect a cloaked pursuer."
msgstr ""
"Wykrywacz ruchu powiadomi cię o o prawie każdym poruszającym się obiekcie w "
"promieniu pięciu metrów, i bezgłośnie cię ostrzeże. To bardzo użyteczna "
"rzecz podczas snu, jeżeli spodziewasz się zamaskowanego prześladowcy."

#: data/json/bionics.json data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Squeaky Ankles"
msgid_plural "Squeaky Ankles"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Squeaky Ankles'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"In a cruel twist of fate, a poorly executed CBM surgery has given you a pair"
" of useless bionics which make squeaking noises when you walk."
msgstr ""
"Parszywy los spowodował, że źle przeprowadzona chirurgiczna instalacja "
"sytemu CBM obarczyła cię parą bezużytecznych bionik, które wydają piszczące "
"dźwięki podczas chodzenia."

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Alloy Plating - Arms"
msgstr "Opancerzenie Ramion"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Alloy Plating - Arms'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"The flesh on your arms and hands have been surgically replaced by alloy "
"plating.  Provides 6 bash and cut protection, 5 ballistic protection, and "
"can be used in conjunction with bionic martial arts."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Protective Lenses"
msgstr "Ochronne Soczewki"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Protective Lenses'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your eye sockets have been surgically sealed with highly protective mirrored"
" lenses and your tear ducts have been re-routed to your mouth.  Provides 3 "
"bash and cut protection, and 7 environmental protection."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Alloy Plating - head"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Alloy Plating - head'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"The flesh on your head has been surgically replaced by alloy plating, "
"protecting both your head and jaw regions.  Provides 6 bash and cut "
"protection, and 5 ballistic protection."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Alloy Plating - Legs"
msgstr "Opancerzenie Nóg"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Alloy Plating - Legs'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"The flesh on your legs and feet have been surgically replaced by alloy "
"plating.  Provides 6 bash and cut protection, 5 ballistic protection, and "
"can be used in conjunction with bionic martial arts."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Alloy Plating - torso"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Alloy Plating - torso'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"The flesh on your torso has been surgically replaced by alloy plating, "
"protecting it from physical trauma.  Provides 6 bash and cut protection, and"
" 5 ballistic protection."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Battery System"
msgstr "System Bateryjny"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Battery System'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"You have a battery draining attachment, and thus can make use of the energy "
"contained in normal, everyday batteries.  Use 'E' to drain charge from a "
"battery.  Can be toggled on and off at will."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Monomolecular Blade"
msgstr "Ostrze Monomolekularne"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Monomolecular Blade'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A deadly 30cm-long blade made of advanced material now resides inside your "
"forearm, capable of being extended through the back of your wrist at the "
"cost of a small amount of power.  Though exceptionally sharp, it will "
"prevent you from holding anything else while extended."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Monofilament Whip"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Monofilament Whip'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your left hand conceals three meters of monomolecular filament on an "
"artificial diamond spool, extending behind a small counterweight in your "
"thumbtip.  It requires a small amount of bionic power to activate, and "
"prevents you from holding anything else while extended."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Shotgun Arm"
msgstr "Ramię-Strzelba"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Shotgun Arm'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Concealed in your left arm is a 12 gauge shotgun.  Activate the bionic to "
"fire and reload the shotgun."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Optical Dampers"
msgstr "Optyczne Tłumiki"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Optical Dampers'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"The lenses surgically installed over your eyes can be tinted to block out "
"incoming light."
msgstr ""
"Soczewki, które chirurgicznie wszczepiono nad twoimi oczami mogą być "
"przyciemniane by blokować światło."

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Blood Analysis"
msgstr "Analizator Krwi"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Blood Analysis'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Small sensors have been surgically implanted in your heart, allowing you to "
"analyze your blood.  This will detect many illnesses, drugs, and other "
"conditions."
msgstr ""
"Niewielkie sensory zostały chirurgicznie wszczepione w twoje serce, "
"umożliwiając ci analizę własnej krwi. Mogą wykryć wiele chorób, medykamentów"
" i narkotyków, oraz innych stanów."

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Blood Filter"
msgstr "Filtr Krwi"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Blood Filter'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A filtration system in your heart allows you to actively filter out chemical"
" impurities, primarily drugs.  It will have limited impact on viruses.  Note"
" that it is not a targeted filter; ALL drugs in your system will be "
"affected."
msgstr ""
"System filtracyjny zamontowany w sercu, do aktywnego wychwytywania "
"chemicznych zanieczyszczeń, w szczególności narkotyków. Będzie miał "
"ograniczony wpływ na wirusy. Miej świadomość, że nie jest to filtr celowany,"
" ma wpływ na WSZYSTKIE chemikalia w systemie krwionośnym."

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Cable Charger System"
msgstr "System Ładowania Przewodowego"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Cable Charger System'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"You have a complex port surgically mounted above your hip.  While active, it"
" will recharge bionic power when connected to a power source via cable."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Cable Charger System Mk. II"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Cable Charger System Mk. II'}
#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Cable Charger System CBM Mk. II'}
#: data/json/bionics.json data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This is a military-grade electronic port and power converter system which "
"are surgically mounted above your hip, it has ten times higher throughput "
"than basic version.  While active, it will recharge bionic power when "
"connected to a power source via cable."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Subdermal Carbon Filament"
msgstr "Podskórne Włókna Węglowe"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Subdermal Carbon Filament'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Lying just beneath your skin is a thin armor made of carbon nanotubes.  This"
" reduces all bashing damage by 5%, cutting damage by 10%, and ballistic "
"damage by 15%."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json data/json/items/gun/bio.json
msgid "Chain Lightning"
msgid_plural "Chain Lightnings"
msgstr[0] "Cewki Piorunów Łańcuchowych"
msgstr[1] "Cewki Piorunów Łańcuchowych"
msgstr[2] "Cewki Piorunów Łańcuchowych"
msgstr[3] "Cewki Piorunów Łańcuchowych"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Chain Lightning'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your body is equipped with a chain lightning generator, allowing you to emit"
" a blast of lightning at a target, leaving a trail of lightning in its wake,"
" jumping to additional targets within 4 tiles of the previous target."
msgstr ""
"Twoje ciało wyposażono w cewki generujące i miotające widowiskowe pioruny "
"łańcuchowe, które wymierzone w cel na kolejne pobliskie cele w promieniu 4 "
"kroków od pierwotnego celu."

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Bionic Claws"
msgstr "Bioniczne Szpony"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Bionic Claws'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Vicious claws have been surgically installed inside your hands, allowing you"
" to extend and retract them at the cost of a small amount of power.  These "
"do considerable cutting damage, but prevent you from holding anything else "
"while extended."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Internal Climate Control"
msgstr "Wewnętrzna Klimatyzacja"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Internal Climate Control'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Throughout your body lies a network of thermal piping, which eases the "
"effects of high and low ambient temperatures when activated."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Cloaking System"
msgstr "System Maskujący"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Cloaking System'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This high-power system uses a set of cameras and LEDs to make you blend into"
" your background, rendering you fully invisible to normal vision.  However, "
"you may be detected by infrared, sonar, etc."
msgstr ""
"Ten prądożerny system używa wbudowanych kamer i diod by wtopić cie w tło, "
"zapewniając pełną niewidzialność dla nieuzbrojonego oka. Można nadal cię "
"wykryć w podczerwieni, sonarem, itp."

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Close Quarters Battle"
msgstr "System Wspomagania Walki Bezpośredniej"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Close Quarters Battle'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Bionic processors and databanks, loaded with martial arts combat programs, "
"are surgically integrated into your nervous system.  Whilst active, the CQB "
"module will improve your hand to hand combat skills, but prevents you from "
"improving them through combat experience."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Bionic-Induced Deformity"
msgid_plural "Bionic-Induced Deformities"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Bionic-Induced Deformity'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A combination of poor surgical installation and unpleasant scarring has lead"
" to the malfunctioning bionic catastrophe you call your face.  People who "
"mind that you look like a dime-store Frankenstein will react poorly to your "
"appearance."
msgstr ""
"Kombinacja kiepskiej jakości chirurgicznych instalacji i nieprzyjemnych "
"blizn dała w rezultacie źle funkcjonującą bioniczną katastrofę, którą "
"nazywasz twarzą."

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Wired Reflexes"
msgstr "Okablowany Refleks"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Wired Reflexes'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your reaction time has been greatly enhanced with bionic nerve stimulators, "
"giving you a +2 bonus to dexterity."
msgstr ""
"Twój czas reakcji został znacznie zwiększony przez okablowanie szybko "
"przewodzącymi bionicznymi wiązkami nerwowymi, co polepsza twoją zręczność o "
"dwa stopnie."

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Expanded Digestive System"
msgstr "Rozszerzony System Trawienny"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Expanded Digestive System'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"You have been outfitted with a synthetic stomach and industrial-grade "
"intestines.  Not only can you extract much more nutrition from food, but you"
" are immune to foodborne illness, parasites, and can even eat rotten food."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Acidic Discharge"
msgid_plural "Acidic Discharges"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Acidic Discharge'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A malfunctioning bionic which occasionally discharges acid into your "
"muscles, causing sharp pain and minor damage."
msgstr ""
"Źle funkcjonująca bionika od czasu do czasu zalewa twoje mięśnie kwasem, "
"powodując ostry ból i niewielkie obrażenia."

#: data/json/bionics.json data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Electrical Discharge"
msgid_plural "Electrical Discharges"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Electrical Discharge'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A malfunctioning bionic which occasionally discharges electricity through "
"your body, causing pain and brief paralysis but no damage."
msgstr ""
"Źle funkcjonująca bionika od czasu do czasu razi twoje ciało prądem, "
"powodując ostry ból i chwilowy paraliż, ale nie powodując obrażeń."

#: data/json/bionics.json data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Electrical Drain"
msgid_plural "Electrical Drains"
msgstr[0] "Elektryczny Syfon"
msgstr[1] "Elektryczny Syfon"
msgstr[2] "Elektryczny Syfon"
msgstr[3] "Elektryczny Syfon"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Electrical Drain'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A malfunctioning bionic.  It doesn't perform any useful function, but will "
"occasionally draw power from your batteries."
msgstr ""
"Popsuta bionika. Nie robi nic użytecznego, ale od czasu do czasu pobiera moc"
" z twoich baterii."

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Sound Dampeners"
msgstr "Tłumiki Dźwięku"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Sound Dampeners'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"When this bionic is active, you can block hearing completely (with Enhanced "
"Hearing deactivated) or dampen sound slightly (with Enhanced Hearing "
"activated)."
msgstr ""
"Gdy ta bionika jest aktywna, możesz całkowicie zablokować słuch (przy "
"nieaktywnym Ulepszonym Słuchu) lub nieco wytłumić dźwięki (przy aktywnym "
"Ulepszonym Słuchu)."

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Enhanced Hearing"
msgstr "Ulepszony Słuch CBM"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Enhanced Hearing'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"When this bionic is active, your hearing will be drastically improved, "
"allowing you to hear ten times better than the average person.  "
"Additionally, high-intensity sounds will be automatically dampened before "
"they can damage your hearing, and preexisting hearing problems will be "
"fixed."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json data/json/items/gun/bio.json
msgid "EMP Projector"
msgid_plural "EMP Projectors"
msgstr[0] "rzutnik EMP"
msgstr[1] "rzutnik EMP"
msgstr[2] "rzutnik EMP"
msgstr[3] "rzutnik EMP"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'EMP Projector'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A ranged EMP generator system is implanted on the palm of your right hand "
"and arm.  The system fires precise, single-target pulses that require time "
"to aim.  Extremely effective against electronic targets but mostly useless "
"otherwise."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Ethanol Burner"
msgstr "Spalacz Etanolu"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Ethanol Burner'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "You burn alcohol as fuel in an extremely efficient reaction."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Aero-Evaporator"
msgstr "Areo-Skraplacz"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Aero-Evaporator'}
#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Aero-Evaporator CBM'}
#: data/json/bionics.json data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This unit draws moisture from the surrounding air, which slowly trickles "
"directly into your blood stream.  It may fail in very dry environments."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Diamond Cornea"
msgstr "Diamentowa Rogówka"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Diamond Cornea'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your vision is greatly enhanced, giving you a +2 bonus to perception and "
"fixing any vision problems."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Telescopic Lenses"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Telescopic Lenses'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"The lenses in your eyes have been surgically removed and replaced with an "
"array of high-powered, auto-focusing lenses.  They function as integrated "
"binoculars, letting you see much farther than before, and any mundane vision"
" problems you might have had are now gone."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Facial Distortion"
msgstr "Rzeźbiarz Twarzy"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Facial Distortion'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Through controlled application of electrochemical impulses, you are capable "
"of altering your facial structure so as to subtly affect the reactions of "
"others.  This grants a bonus to all social interactions."
msgstr ""
"System kontrolujący elektrochemiczne impulsy mięśni twarzy, dostosowujący "
"jej strukturę i mimikę by subtelnie wpływać na reakcje innych ludzi. Daje "
"bonus do wszystkich interakcji społecznych."

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Dielectric Capacitance System"
msgstr "Dielektryczne Kondensatory"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Dielectric Capacitance System'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Throughout your body lies a network of miniature piezoelectric capacitors "
"which can be charged with bionic power to temporarily protect you from "
"external electrical discharge."
msgstr ""
"W poprzek twojego ciała rozmieszczono sieć miniaturowych piezoelektrycznych "
"kondensatorów, które można naładować bioniczną mocą, by chwilowo "
"zabezpieczyć cię przez zewnętrznym porażeniem prądem elektrycznym."

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Fingerhack"
msgstr "Palcowy E-Wytrych"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Fingerhack'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"One of your fingers has an electrohack surgically embedded in it; an all-"
"purpose hacking unit used to override control panels and the like (but not "
"computers).  Skill in computers is important, and a failed use may damage "
"your circuits."
msgstr ""
"Jeden z twoich palców ma chirurgicznie zainstalowane elektroniczne "
"uniwersalne urządzenie hakujące przeznaczone do hakowania paneli kontrolnych"
" i im podobnych urządzeń, lecz nie komputerów. Wymagana jest znajomość "
"komputerów, a nieudane próby mogą usmażyć twoje obwody."

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Flashbang Generator"
msgstr "Ogłuszasz Światło-Hukowy"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Flashbang Generator'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Light emitting diodes surgically integrated into your skin can release a "
"flash comparable to a flashbang grenade, blinding nearby enemies.  Speakers "
"integrated into your body mimic the loud sound, deafening those nearby."
msgstr ""
"Wbudowane chirurgicznie w ciało stroboskopowe diody mogą wyzwolić błysk "
"porównywalny z granatem ogłuszającym, a specjalne zintegrowane z ciałem "
"głośniki imitują jego głośny dźwięk, ogłuszając pobliskie stworzenia."

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Cranial Flashlight"
msgstr "Latarka Czaszkowa"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Cranial Flashlight'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Surgically mounted between your eyes is a small but powerful LED flashlight."
msgstr ""
"W czaszce pomiędzy oczami zamontowano ci chirurgicznie małą ale intensywną "
"latarkę ledową."

#: data/json/bionics.json data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "LED Tattoo"
msgid_plural "LED Tattoos"
msgstr[0] "LEDowy tatuaż"
msgstr[1] "LEDowe tatuaże"
msgstr[2] "LEDowe tatuaże"
msgstr[3] "LEDowe tatuaże"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'LED Tattoo'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A small LED display just beneath your dermal layer can be illuminated on "
"command to show patterns of your choice at dim or bright luminosity.  It "
"doesn't provide enough light, but it can suffice for reading or crafting if "
"you have nothing else."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Glowy Thing"
msgid_plural "Glowy Things"
msgstr[0] "Świecąca Rzecz"
msgstr[1] "Świecąca Rzecz"
msgstr[2] "Świecąca Rzecz"
msgstr[3] "Świecąca Rzecz"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Glowy Thing'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"You don't think that capacitor is *meant* to glow, but it does, and usually "
"at bad times.  A malfunctioning bionic randomly turns on and off, causing "
"you to glow and making you visible in the dark without improving how much "
"you can see in the slightest."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Integrated Dosimeter"
msgstr "Zintegrowany Dozymetr"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Integrated Dosimeter'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Small radiation sensors have been surgically implanted throughout your body,"
" allowing you to analyze your level of absorbed radiation.  They will also "
"alert you whenever exposed to environmental radiation."
msgstr ""
"Niewielkie detektory radiacji implantowano chirurgicznie w różnych miejscach"
" twojego ciała, umożliwiając kontrolę przyjętych dawek promieniowania. "
"Ponadto ostrzegą cię gdy wystawisz się na zewnętrzne promieniowanie."

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Respirator"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Respirator'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A complex respiration augmentation system.  Improves respiration ability in "
"air and allows breathing water.  Will automatically turn on when drowning.  "
"Turn on to recharge stamina faster, at moderate power cost.  Asthmatics may "
"also use it to stop asthma attacks."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Terranian Sonar"
msgstr "Sonar Ziemny"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Terranian Sonar'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your feet are equipped with precision sonar equipment, allowing you to "
"detect the movements of creatures below the ground, buried traps, and "
"unstable terrain."
msgstr ""
"Twoje stopy zaopatrzono w precyzyjny system sonarowy, pozwalający na "
"wykryciu ruchu stworzeń pod ziemią, zakopanych pułapek, i niestabilnego "
"gruntu."

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Heat Drain"
msgstr "Odsysacz Ciepła"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Heat Drain'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"While fighting unarmed against a warm-blooded opponent, there is a chance "
"that a successful hit will drain body heat, inflicting a small amount of "
"extra damage, and increasing your power reserves slightly."
msgstr ""
"W walce wręcz z ciepłokrwistym przeciwnikiem istnieje mała szansa, że "
"skuteczny cios spowoduje wyssanie ciepła z ciała przeciwnika, zadając "
"dodatkowe obrażenia i nieznacznie regenerując twoje rezerwy mocy."

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Thermal Dissipation"
msgstr "Rozpraszacz Ciepła"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Thermal Dissipation'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Powerful heatsinks and supermaterials are surgically woven into your flesh."
"  While powered, this system will prevent heat damage up to 2000 degrees "
"Fahrenheit.  Note that this does not affect your internal temperature."
msgstr ""
"W twoją skórę są chirurgicznie wplecione wydajne pompy ciepła i "
"supermateriały , które zapobiegają obrażeniom cieplnym rozpraszając żar o "
"temperaturze do 1100 stopni Celsjusza, pod warunkiem że są zasilane. Nie "
"wpływają na wewnętrzną temperaturę ciała."

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Hydraulic Muscles"
msgstr "Hydrauliczne Mięśnie"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Hydraulic Muscles'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"While activated, your muscles will be greatly enhanced, increasing your "
"strength by 20."
msgstr ""
"Aktywowany, potężnie wzmacnia mięśnie, podnosząc siłę o dwadzieścia "
"jednostek."

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Bionic Infolink"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Bionic Infolink'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A state of the art communications and information package has been installed"
" in your body.  While the cell phone network may be down, it can still "
"double as a two-way radio.  Additionally tells you the time and local air "
"temperature, provides a silent alarm clock function, and if activated will "
"give a more detailed readout on local weather conditions."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Infrared Vision"
msgstr "Podczerwony Wzrok"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Infrared Vision'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your range of vision extends into the infrared, allowing you to see warm-"
"blooded creatures in the dark or through smoke."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Cerebral Booster"
msgstr "Booster Czaszkowy"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Cerebral Booster'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your brain has been enhanced with bionic coprocessors, giving you a +2 bonus"
" to intelligence."
msgstr ""
"Wsparcie twojego mózgu bionicznymi koprocesorami, podwyższa twą inteligencję"
" o dwa stopnie."

#: data/json/bionics.json data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Itchy Metal Thing"
msgid_plural "Itchy Metal Things"
msgstr[0] "Swędząca Metalowa Rzecz"
msgstr[1] "Swędząca Metalowa Rzecz"
msgstr[2] "Swędząca Metalowa Rzecz"
msgstr[3] "Swędząca Metalowa Rzecz"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Itchy Metal Thing'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A bionic of some sort, so badly installed that you cannot even tell what it "
"was originally supposed to be.  Sometimes it itches horribly."
msgstr ""
"Jakaś bionika, tak źle zainstalowana, że nawet nie możesz powiedzieć co to "
"pierwotnie miało być. Od czasu do czasu okropnie swędzi."

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Finger-Mounted Laser"
msgstr "Laserowy Palec"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Finger-Mounted Laser'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"One of your fingers has a small high-powered laser surgically embedded in "
"it.  This long range weapon is not incredibly damaging, but is very "
"accurate, and has the potential to start fires."
msgstr ""
"Jeden z twoich palców mieści chirurgicznie wmontowany mały laser wysokiej "
"mocy. Ta dalekosiężna broń nie zadaje wielkich obrażeń, ale jest bardzo "
"celna i można nią rozpalać ogień."

#: data/json/bionics.json data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Leaky Bionic"
msgid_plural "Leaky Bionics"
msgstr[0] "Przeciekająca Bionika"
msgstr[1] "Przeciekające Bioniki"
msgstr[2] "Przeciekających Bionik"
msgstr[3] "Przeciekających Bionik"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Leaky Bionic'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This botched piece of bionic hardware slowly leaks electrolytic compounds, "
"piezoelectric nanomaterials, and other high-tech contaminants into your "
"bloodstream.  Needless to say, this is not good for your health."
msgstr ""
"Z tego partackiego kawałka bionicznego złomu powoli wyciekają do twojej krwi"
" elektrolity, piezoelektryczne nanomateriały, i inne skażenia wysokich "
"technologii. Nie trzeba tłumaczyć, że nie jest to dobre dla twojego zdrowia."

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Leukocyte Breeder System"
msgstr "Namnażacz Leukocytów"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Leukocyte Breeder System'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"You are equipped with bionic stimulators which augment your haematopoiesis "
"system, allowing you to accelerate white blood cell production using bionic "
"power.  It is supposed to run continuously and may cause unpleasant side "
"effects when turned off."
msgstr ""
"Wszczepiono ci bioniczne stymulatory wspomagające system hematopoezy, "
"pozwalając na akcelerację tempa produkcji białych krwinek z użyciem "
"bionicznej mocy. Zaprojektowany do ciągłej pracy, i może spowodować "
"nieprzyjemne skutki uboczne gdy zostanie wyłączony."

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Finger Lighter"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Finger Lighter'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"The index fingers of both hands have powerful fire starters which extend "
"from the tip."
msgstr ""
"Oba twoje palce wskazujące mają obecnie wysuwane z koniuszków  potężne "
"urządzenia do podpalania."

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Fingerpick"
msgstr "Placowytrych"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Fingerpick'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"One of your fingers has an electronic lockpick surgically embedded in it.  "
"This automatic system will quickly unlock all but the most advanced key "
"locks without any skill required on the part of the user.  If you're "
"crouched, examining a locked door will have you prioritize picking the lock "
"instead of using a crowbar on it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Electromagnetic Unit"
msgstr "Elektromagnes"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Electromagnetic Unit'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Surgically embedded in your right hand is a powerful electromagnet, allowing"
" you to use your own strength to pull all nearby magnetic objects towards "
"you.  Unlucky bystanders might be injured or killed by flying objects."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Nictating Membrane"
msgstr "Druga Powieka"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Nictating Membrane'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your eyes have a thin membrane that closes over your eyes while underwater, "
"negating any vision penalties."
msgstr ""
"Twoje oczy zaopatrzono w  cienką przezroczystą membranę, która zamyka się "
"jak powieka, i pozwala widzieć w wodzie bez żadnych przeszkód."

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Enhanced Memory Banks"
msgstr "Zwiększone Banki Pamięci"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Enhanced Memory Banks'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your memory has been enhanced with small quantum storage drives.  While "
"active, you learn - both through reading and practice - more quickly.  "
"Additionally, you can't forget skills you've already learned."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Metabolic Interchange"
msgstr "System Wymiany Metabolicznej"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Metabolic Interchange'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your digestive system and power supply are interconnected; bionic energy is "
"replenished by burning calories.  Can be toggled on and off at will."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Repair Nanobots"
msgstr "Nanoboty Naprawcze"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Repair Nanobots'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Inside your body is a fleet of tiny dormant robots.  While activated they "
"will reduce the intensity of one bleed effect every 30 seconds, and heal all"
" injured body parts by 1 HP (or broken limbs by 1%) every 2 minutes if you "
"have 3 kJ bionic power and 5 kcal per body part.  If you don't have enough, "
"they will prioritize based on the resources you have."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Artificial Night Generator"
msgstr "Generator Sztucznej Nocy"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Artificial Night Generator'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"When active, this bionic eliminates all light within a 2 tile radius through"
" destructive interference."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Implanted Night Vision"
msgstr "Implantowany Noktowizor"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Implanted Night Vision'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"When active, this bionic will amplify existing light, allowing you to see in"
" the dark."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Noisemaker"
msgid_plural "Noisemakers"
msgstr[0] "Grzechotka"
msgstr[1] "Grzechotka"
msgstr[2] "Grzechotka"
msgstr[3] "Grzechotka"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Noisemaker'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A malfunctioning bionic.  It will occasionally emit a loud burst of noise."
msgstr "Popsuta bionika. Od czasu do czasu emituje głośne dźwięki."

#: data/json/bionics.json data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Bionic Nostril"
msgid_plural "Bionic Nostrils"
msgstr[0] "Bioniczne Nozdrze"
msgstr[1] "Bioniczne Nozdrza"
msgstr[2] "Bionicznych Nozdrzy"
msgstr[3] "Bionicznych Nozdrzy"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Bionic Nostril'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"You're really not sure how the CBM ended up in your nose, but no matter how "
"it got there this badly misplaced bionic makes it difficult to breathe.  "
"Increases mouth encumbrance by ten."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Offensive Defense System"
msgstr "Ofensywny System Obronny"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Offensive Defense System'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A thin forcefield surrounds your body, continually draining power.  This "
"field does not deflect attacks, but rather delivers a strong shock, damaging"
" unarmed attackers and those with a conductive weapon."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Sensory Dulling"
msgstr "Wygłuszanie Zmysłów"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Sensory Dulling'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your nervous system is wired to allow you to inhibit the signals of pain, "
"allowing you to dull your senses at will.  However, the use of this system "
"may cause delayed reaction time and drowsiness."
msgstr ""
"Twój okablowany system nerwowy może wytłumiać sygnały bólu, otępiając zmysły"
" na skinienie woli. Skutkiem ubocznym może być spowolnienie reakcji i "
"senność."

#: data/json/bionics.json data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Bionic Visual Impairment"
msgid_plural "Bionic Visual Impairments"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Bionic Visual Impairment'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Due to a badly misplaced dielectric stylette, you are now suffering from "
"mild optic neuropathy.  Increases eye encumbrance by ten."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Power Armor Interface"
msgstr "Interfejs Pancerza Wspomaganego"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Power Armor Interface'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Interfaces your bionic power system with the internal charging port on suits"
" of power armor, allowing them to draw from the user's bionic power banks.  "
"Twice as efficient as using a UPS."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Power Armor Interface Mk. II"
msgstr "Interfejs Pancerza Wspomaganego II Gen."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Power Armor Interface Mk. II'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Interfaces your bionic power system with the internal charging port on suits"
" of power armor, allowing them to draw from the user's bionic power banks.  "
"Four times as efficient as using a UPS, the Mk. II was designed by "
"DoubleTech Inc., to meet the popularity of the Mk. II power armor series."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Power Storage"
msgstr "Magazyn Mocy"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Power Storage'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A Compact Bionics Module that increases your power capacity by 100 kJ.  "
"Having at least one of these is a prerequisite to using powered bionics.  "
"You will also need a power supply, found in various CBMs."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Power Storage Mk. II"
msgstr "Magazyn Mocy II Gen."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Power Storage Mk. II'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "A Compact Bionics Module that increases your power capacity by 250 kJ."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Power Overload"
msgid_plural "Power Overloads"
msgstr[0] "Przeciążenie Mocy"
msgstr[1] "Przeciążenia Mocy"
msgstr[2] "Przeciążeń Mocy"
msgstr[3] "Przeciążeń Mocy"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Power Overload'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Damaged power circuits cause short-circuiting inside your muscles when your "
"batteries are above 75% capacity, causing greatly reduced strength.  This "
"has no effect if you have no internal batteries."
msgstr ""
"Uszkodzone przewody pod napięciem powodują krótkie spięcia wewnątrz twoich "
"mięśni gdy baterie są powyżej 75% pojemności, w rezultacie znacznie "
"obniżając siłę. Efekt ten nie występuje gdy nie masz wewnętrznego zasilania."

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Probability Travel"
msgstr "Moduł Podróży Probabilistycznej"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Probability Travel'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Increases your body's wavelength, allowing you to quantum tunnel through "
"walls, reappearing on the other side.  Activate and select a direction to "
"use.  Tunneling costs 100 bionic power per tile traveled through."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Air Filtration System (passive)"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Air Filtration System (passive)'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Surgically implanted in your trachea is an advanced filtration system.  In "
"it's passive form it will protect you against smoke inhalation and even "
"particulate matter that triggers asthma attacks.  Once activated, it will "
"prevent spores, toxins and diseases from being inhaled."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Air Filtration System (active)"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Air Filtration System (active)'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Surgically implanted in your trachea is an advanced filtration system.  In "
"it's passive form it will protect you against smoke inhalation.  Once "
"activated, it will prevent spores, toxins and diseases from being inhaled."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Radiation Scrubber System"
msgstr "System Filtracji Radiacyjnej"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Radiation Scrubber System'}
#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Radiation Scrubber System CBM'}
#: data/json/bionics.json data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A system of advanced piezomechanical blood filters have been surgically "
"implanted throughout your body, allowing you to purge yourself of absorbed "
"radiation at the cost of some bionic power.  While activated if irradiated "
"stacks are present will remove 1 stack of irradiated every 10 minutes "
"costing 10kJ."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Railgun"
msgstr "Działo Elektromagnetyczne"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Railgun'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"EM field generators in your arms double the range and increase damage of "
"thrown iron and steel objects at a cost of 1kJ per throw, causing them to "
"leave a trail of electricity that can cause additional damage."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Fingertip Razors"
msgstr "Paznokciowe Żyletki"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Fingertip Razors'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"You possess razor-sharp claws underneath your fingernails that do a fair "
"amount of unarmed slashing damage whenever your fingertips are uncovered, "
"and which you can use with some precision to cut and butcher.."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Recycler Unit"
msgstr "Jednostka Recyklingu"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Recycler Unit'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your digestive system has been outfitted with a series of filters and "
"processors, allowing you to reclaim waste liquid and, to a lesser degree, "
"nutrients.  The net effect is a greatly reduced need to eat and drink."
msgstr ""
"Twój system wydalniczy wyposażono w dodatkowe filtry moczu i procesory "
"strawionego jedzenia, pozwalające na większy odzysk płynów, i  - w mniejszym"
" stopniu - składników odżywczych. Efektem jest znaczne ograniczenie "
"zapotrzebowania na wodę i żywność."

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Remote Controller"
msgstr "Zdalne Sterowanie"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Remote Controller'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A small module connected to your brain allows you to interface with nearby "
"devices with wireless capabilities."
msgstr ""
"Mały moduł implantowany w mózgu pozwala ci wchodzić w interakcję z "
"pobliskimi urządzeniami zaopatrzonymi w interfejsy bezprzewodowe."

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Sonic Resonator"
msgstr "Soniczny Rezonator"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Sonic Resonator'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your entire body may resonate at very high power, creating a short-range "
"shockwave.  While it will not do much damage to creatures, solid objects "
"such as walls and doors will be damaged."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Olfactory Mask"
msgstr "System Maskowania Zapachów"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Olfactory Mask'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"While this system is powered, your body will produce very little odor, "
"making it nearly impossible for creatures to track you by scent."
msgstr ""
"Zasilenie tego systemu spowoduje że twoje, ciało będzie wydzielać bardzo "
"mało zapachów, praktycznie uniemożliwiając istotom wytropienie się węchem."

#: data/json/bionics.json data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Bionic Short Circuit"
msgid_plural "Bionic Short Circuits"
msgstr[0] "Bioniczne Krótkie Spięcie"
msgstr[1] "Bioniczne Krótkie Spięcia"
msgstr[2] "Bionicznych Krótkich Spięć"
msgstr[3] "Bionicznych Krótkich Spięć"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Bionic Short Circuit'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A poorly-wired bionic which fails to serve its intended purpose, this "
"malfunctioning device periodically short-circuits, causing systemic muscle "
"tremors."
msgstr ""
"Źle okablowana bionika, która nie spełnia pierwotnej funkcji, a jej "
"uszkodzenia od czasu do czasu powodują krótkie spięcia, powodując "
"systematyczne drgawki mięśni."

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Synaptic Regeneration System"
msgstr "System Regeneracji Synaptycznej"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Synaptic Regeneration System'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"An electromagnetic stimulator has been surgically implanted on the back of "
"your head and along your spine, continually draining power.  As long as it's"
" active, you won't become sleep deprived; and if you're sleep deprived "
"already, it will boost the rate of recovery while you sleep."
msgstr ""
"Elektromagnetyczny stymulator został chirurgicznie implantowany z tyłu "
"twojej głowy i wzdłóż kręgosłupa, stale pobierając moc. Gdy jest aktywny nie"
" doświadczysz deprywacji snu, a jeśli już na nią cierpisz, pomoże w "
"regeneracji sił podczas snu."

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Electroshock Unit"
msgstr "Jednostka Elektroszoku"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Electroshock Unit'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"While fighting unarmed, or with a weapon that conducts electricity, there is"
" a chance that a successful hit will shock your opponent, inflicting extra "
"damage and disabling them temporarily at the cost of some energy."
msgstr ""
"Walcząc bez broni lub przewodzącą prąd bronią, jest szansa że udany cios "
"porazi prądem przeciwnika, zadając dodatkowe obrażenia i paraliżując "
"chwilowo kosztem zużycia pewnej porcji energii."

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Shockwave Generator"
msgstr "Generator Fal Uderzeniowych"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Shockwave Generator'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"You generate a powerful shockwave, knocking back all nearby creatures.  "
"Targets are stunned briefly, take damage and additional stun upon impact "
"with impassable terrain, and knockback any creatures they collide with."
msgstr ""
"Generujesz potężne fale uderzeniowe, odrzucając pobliskie stworzenia. Cele "
"otrzymują obrażenia są chwilowo ogłuszone, w tym w skutek uderzenia w "
"przeszkody i powalają inne stworzenia, na które wpadną."

#: data/json/bionics.json data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Endocrine Enervator"
msgid_plural "Endocrine Enervators"
msgstr[0] "Wewnątrzwydzielniczy Podrażniacz"
msgstr[1] "Wewnątrzwydzielnicze Podrażniacze"
msgstr[2] "Wewnątrzwydzielniczych Podrażniaczy"
msgstr[3] "Wewnątrzwydzielniczych Podrażniaczy"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Endocrine Enervator'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Through a combination of psychochemical manipulation and old fashioned "
"electrical nerve stimulation, this malfunctioning bionic alters your brain "
"chemistry in such a way as to cause fatigue.  You will find yourself tiring "
"a bit faster than before."
msgstr ""
"Przez kombinację manipulacji psychochemicznej i staromodnej elektrycznej "
"stymulacji nerwów, ta popsuta bionika zmienia chemię twojego mózgu w sposób "
"powodujący zmęczenie. Będziesz się męczył zauważalnie szybciej niż "
"poprzednio."

#: data/json/bionics.json data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Motor Control Overstimulator"
msgid_plural "Motor Control Overstimulators"
msgstr[0] "Nadstymulator Funkcji Motorycznych"
msgstr[1] "Nadstymulatory Funkcji Motorycznych"
msgstr[2] "Nadstymulatorów Funkcji Motorycznych"
msgstr[3] "Nadstymulatorów Funkcji Motorycznych"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Motor Control Overstimulator'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"One piezoelectric solenoid surgically installed backwards, two crossed "
"wires, and four burned-out capacitors later you started falling on your face"
" and writhing around at the least convenient times.  This incorrectly-"
"configured bionic periodically stuns you for a short duration."
msgstr ""
"Jeden piezoelektryczny solenoid zainstalowany chirurgicznie na odwrót, dwa "
"poplątane przewody, i cztery wypalone kondensatory, i padasz na twarz "
"zwijając się w najmniej sprzyjających okolicznościach. Ta źle skonfigurowana"
" bionika okazjonalnie ogłusza cię na krótki czas."

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Synaptic Accelerator"
msgstr "Akcelerator Synaptyczny"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Synaptic Accelerator'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your nervous system has been enhanced with bionic stimulators, giving you a "
"10% boost to your speed."
msgstr ""
"Twój system nerwowy opleciono bionicznymi stymulatorami, zwiększając twoją "
"szybkość o 10%."

#: data/json/bionics.json data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Wire-Induced Stiffness"
msgid_plural "Wire-Induced Stiffnesses"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Wire-Induced Stiffness'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Improperly installed wires cause a physical stiffness in most of your body, "
"causing increased encumbrance."
msgstr ""
"Niewłaściwie zainstalowane okablowanie powoduje fizyczną sztywność "
"większości twojego ciała, zwiększając jego skrępowanie."

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Muscle Augmentation"
msgstr "Wzmacniacz Mięśni"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Muscle Augmentation'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your muscular system has been surgically enhanced with myomer fibers, giving"
" you a +2 bonus to strength."
msgstr ""
"Twoje system mięśniowy został chirurgicznie ulepszony w elektro-kurczliwe "
"włókna polimerowe, zwiększając twą siłę o dwie jednostki."

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Autonomous Surgical Scalpels"
msgstr "Autonomiczne Skalpele Chirurgiczne"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Autonomous Surgical Scalpels'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A system of surgical grade scalpels is implanted on your fingers.  They "
"allow you to make automated precise cuts and can also be used as a high-"
"quality butchering tool."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Anti-Glare Compensators"
msgstr "Kompensatory Blasku"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Anti-Glare Compensators'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your eyes have quick-reacting transition lenses surgically installed over "
"them.  They negate glare penalties, partially protect you from bright "
"flashes, and protect your eyes when welding."
msgstr ""
"Twoje oczy posiadają chirurgicznie wszczepione fotochromatyczne soczewki "
"ochronne szybkiego reagowania, które negują efekty oślepienia i częściowo "
"chronią przed jasnymi rozbłyskami światła, a także chronią oczy podczas "
"spawania."

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Targeting System"
msgstr "System Celowniczy"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Targeting System'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your eyes are surgically equipped with range finders, and their movement is "
"synced with that of your arms, to a degree.  Shots you fire will be much "
"more accurate, particularly at long range."
msgstr ""
"Twoje oczy zaopatrzono chirurgicznie w dalmierz zsynchronizowany - do "
"pewnego stopnia - z ruchem twoich rąk. Strzały które oddajesz będą dużo "
"bardziej celne, zwłaszcza na duży dystans."

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Teleportation Unit"
msgstr "Moduł Teleportacji"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Teleportation Unit'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This highly experimental unit folds space over short distances, instantly "
"transporting your body up to 25 feet at the cost of much power.  Note that "
"prolonged or frequent use may have dangerous side effects."
msgstr ""
"Ten mocno eksperymentalny moduł zwija przestrzeń na krótkim dystansie, "
"natychmiast przenosząc twoje ciało do 8 metrów kosztem znacznego poboru "
"mocy. Zbyt długie lub częste używanie może mieć niebezpieczne skutki "
"uboczne."

#: data/json/bionics.json data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Self-Locking Thumbs"
msgid_plural "Self-Locking Thumbs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Self-Locking Thumbs'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Self-locking thumbs hold tight (even when you really don't want them to) and"
" don't let go (even when you'd rather they did).  Increases hand encumbrance"
" by ten, while failing to improve your ability to hold objects whatsoever."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Time Dilation"
msgstr "Rozciągacz Czasu"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Time Dilation'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"At the cost of all stored bionic power, you may increase your body speed and"
" reactions dramatically, essentially freezing time.  You are still delicate,"
" however, and violent or rapid movements may damage you due to friction."
msgstr ""
"Kosztem poboru całej zmagazynowanej energii, możesz drastycznie zwiększyć "
"prędkość twojego ciała i reakcji, niejako wstrzymując upływ czasu. Wciąż "
"pozostajesz wrażliwy, i nagłe gwałtowne ruchy mogą spowodować obrażenia z "
"uwagi na tarcie."

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Integrated Toolset"
msgstr "Zintegrowane Narzędzia"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Integrated Toolset'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Surgically implanted in your hands and fingers is a set of tools - "
"screwdriver, hammer, wrench, hacksaw, drill, welder, and heating elements.  "
"You can use this in place of many tools when crafting."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Joint Torsion Ratchet"
msgstr "Przekładnia Zębata"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Joint Torsion Ratchet'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your joints have been surgically equipped with torsion ratchets that slowly "
"generate power when you move.  Whilst this is toggled, moving will require "
"more effort, though more power will be generated."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Joint Servo"
msgstr "Serwo-Stawy"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Joint Servo'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your leg joints have been equipped with servomotors that provide power-"
"assisted movement.  They are optimized for running, but walking also "
"requires less effort.  When unpowered, the bionic still improves your speed "
"slightly by balancing your gait and preventing incorrect or excessive "
"movements, even compensating for joint problems."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Visual Disruptor"
msgid_plural "Visual Disruptors"
msgstr[0] "Zakłócacz Wizji"
msgstr[1] "Zakłócacze Wizji"
msgstr[2] "Zakłócaczy Wizji"
msgstr[3] "Zakłócaczy Wizji"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Visual Disruptor'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A malfunctioning bionic which causes occasional visual distortion and "
"pixelation."
msgstr ""
"Popsuta bionika, która okazjonalnie powoduje zniekształcenia obrazu i "
"pikselizację"

#: data/json/bionics.json data/json/enchantments.json
msgid "Uncanny Dodge"
msgstr "Niesamowity Unik"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Uncanny Dodge'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your nervous system has been augmented with bionic processors, increasing "
"your ability to dodge while active.  Your dodge skill will also grant a "
"chance to evade attacks beyond normal human capability, such as bullets."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json data/json/enchantments.json
msgid "Underwater Propellers"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Underwater Propellers'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your upper torso is fitted with retractable propellers that enable you to "
"swim and maneuver at greater speeds when submerged."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Internal Unified Power System"
msgstr "Wewnętrzny Unifikowany System Zasilania UPS"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Internal Unified Power System'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"You have a Unified Power System wired into your power banks.  Objects that "
"run on a UPS can now draw directly from your bionic power supply."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Voice Remodulator"
msgid_plural "Voice Remodulators"
msgstr[0] "Remodulator Głosu"
msgstr[1] "Remodulatory Głosu"
msgstr[2] "Remodulatorów Głosu"
msgstr[3] "Remodulatorów Głosu"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Voice Remodulator'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"You will likely spend the rest of your days serving as a walking testament "
"to why you don't opt for the Autodoc's 'Cyborg Identity Package'.  A "
"remodulator unit jammed down your throat has given you a creepy robot voice."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Water Extraction Unit"
msgstr "Moduł Ekstraktora Wody"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Water Extraction Unit'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Nanotubes surgically embedded in the palm of your hand will pump any "
"available fluid out of a dead body, cleanse it of impurities and convert it "
"into drinkable water.  You must, however, have a container to store the "
"water in."
msgstr ""
"Nanorurki chirurgicznie wszczepione w twojej ręce potrafią odpompować i "
"oczyścić wodę z martwego ciała, czyniąc ja zdatną do picia. Potrzebujesz do "
"tego pojemnika, żeby zmagazynować uzyskaną wodę."

#: data/json/bionics.json data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Gasoline Fuel Cell CBM"
msgid_plural "Gasoline Fuel Cell CBMs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Gasoline Fuel Cell CBM'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A small gasoline fuel cell fixed to your scapula.  Despite its limited "
"energy output compared to other fuel cells, this device still produces a "
"significant amount of heat dissipated through a heat exhaust protruding from"
" your back.  A diffuse network of bio-plastic bladders has been meshed with "
"your circulatory system and serves as a fuel tank."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Hydrogen Fuel Cell CBM"
msgid_plural "Hydrogen Fuel Cell CBMs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Hydrogen Fuel Cell CBM'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A small hydrogen fuel cell fixed to your scapula.  Fairly efficient and "
"high-yield, though the low density of compressed hydrogen and potential "
"waste heat is a hindrance.  A network of compressors and fuel tanks has been"
" distributed throughout your body, able to compactly store 2 liters of "
"hydrogen."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Micro Reactor"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Micro Reactor'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This stripped down mini-reactor generates impressive amounts of bionic power"
" but slowly irradiates the user when in use.  1 plutonium fuel cell provides"
" 1000 charges producing 10kW of power.  Produces 50W of power while "
"inactive."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Advanced Micro Reactor"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Advanced Micro Reactor'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This stripped down mini-reactor has been heavily modified and is more "
"efficient and safer than the base model.  1 plutonium fuel cell provides "
"1500 charges producing 10kW of power.  Produces 75W of power while inactive."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Micro Reactor Safety Override"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Micro Reactor Safety Override'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Disables the radiation safety protocols allowing for much higher energy "
"production.  While active produces 40kW of power and 1 irradiated stack "
"every 20 turns."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Atomic Battery"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Atomic Battery'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A compact alphavoltaic power source, producing a steady source of limitless "
"bionic power.  Produces 50W of power while active."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Intravenous Needletip"
msgstr "Dożylna Igła"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Intravenous Needletip'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"The flesh of the inside of your middle finger has been replaced with a tube "
"leading into your arteries, with a retractable needle extending out of the "
"tip of the finger when clenched.  This lets you pump intravenous drugs like "
"morphine directly into your bloodstream without needing to carry a syringe."
msgstr ""
"Ciało wewnątrz twojego środkowego palca zastąpiono przewodem prowadzącym do "
"żył z chowaną igła wystającą z końca palca przy zaciśnięciu. To pozwala "
"dozować dożylnie leki takie jak morfina bez konieczności noszenia "
"strzykawki."

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Skeletal Bracing"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Skeletal Bracing'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A framework of lightweight alloy bracing has been installed onto your "
"elbows, knees, and spine, making them far better at handling strain and "
"fixing any spinal issues.  Your carrying capacity is increased by 20 "
"kilograms, or about 44 pounds."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Kinetic Shock Absorbers"
msgstr "Kinetyczny Amortyzator"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Kinetic Shock Absorbers'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Most of the flesh in your arms, legs, and upper torso has been replaced with"
" industrial-strength springs and protective padding.  Clenching your fist "
"allows you to fold and unfold this padding; while active, the hydraulic "
"absorbers will prevent damage to your body from severe impacts, at the cost "
"of impaired movement."
msgstr ""
"Większość twoich rąk, nóg i górnej części tułowia została zastąpiona "
"przemysłowej wytrzymałości sprężynami i ochronną wyściółką. Zaciskając "
"pięść, możesz złożyć i rozwinąć tę wyściółkę. Gdy aktywne, hydrauliczne "
"amortyzatory zapobiegają obrażeniom ciała od silnych upadków, kosztem "
"ograniczonej zdolności ruchów."

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Taste Modifier"
msgstr "Modyfikator Zmysłu Smaku"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Taste Modifier'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A set of highly sensitive sensors is installed in your mouth.  The active "
"bionic will nullify the taste of all comestibles with negative enjoyment "
"value at the cost of draining bionic power."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Soporific Induction"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Soporific Induction'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"An electrode has been implanted into your brain's ventrolateral preoptic "
"nucleus.  It turns on whenever you're trying to fall asleep, creating an "
"artificial but effective sensation of fatigue."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Solar Panels"
msgstr "Panele Słoneczne"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Solar Panels'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Installed on your back is a set of retractable, reinforced solar panels "
"resembling angular butterfly wings.  When in direct sunlight, they will "
"automatically deploy and slowly recharge your power level."
msgstr ""
"Na twoich plecach zainstalowany jest zestaw składanych, wzmocnionych paneli "
"słonecznych przypominających skrzydła motyla. W promieniach słonecznych "
"automatycznie rozłożą się i powoli odnowią twoje zasoby mocy."

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Deployable Grenade Launcher"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Deployable Grenade Launcher'}
#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Deployable Grenade Launcher CBM'}
#: data/json/bionics.json data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your right hand can fold inward to reveal a mechanism capable of igniting "
"and firing 40mm grenades across medium distances with great accuracy due "
"built in ballistic calculator."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Linguistic Coprocessor"
msgstr "Współprocesor Lingwistyczny"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Linguistic Coprocessor'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"The left hemisphere of your brain has been augmented with a microcomputer "
"that moderately increases the speed that language and written words are "
"processed, granting a 25% increase to reading speed."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Dopamine Stimulators"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Dopamine Stimulators'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Tiny cybernetic stimulators have been installed throughout your ventral "
"tegmental area, and trigger at set intervals using bionic power.  This "
"slowly releases a stream of reward chemicals and hormones into your brain, "
"inducing a state of euphoria that notably elevates mood."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Fusion Blaster Arm"
msgstr "Ręka - Blaster Fuzyjny"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Fusion Blaster Arm'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A heavy-duty fusion blaster was integrated into your left arm!  You may use "
"your energy banks to fire a damaging heat ray."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Electrosense Scanner"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Electrosense Scanner'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Activating this bionic will allow you to see robots and other electric "
"creatures through walls, at the cost of steadily draining power."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Electrosense Voltmeter"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Electrosense Voltmeter'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Using this bionic allows you to check the status of any local grid "
"connections or battery charge in your surroundings, as well as make "
"modifications to grid connections."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Electrosense Bionic Scanner"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Electrosense Bionic Scanner'}
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Activating this bionic scans nearby corpses for bionics at 750J per bionic."
"  If you do not possess enough bionic power to scan 1 bionic, it "
"deactivates."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Perpetual Generator"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Perpetual Generator'}
#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Perpetual Generator CBM'}
#: data/json/bionics.json data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Installed within you is a perpetual generator powered by nonsensoleum.  When"
" activated its power gen doubles.  If you are seeing this, you'd better be "
"debugging."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/bionics.json data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Debug Fuel Cell CBM"
msgid_plural "Debug Fuel Cell CBMs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Debug Fuel Cell CBM'}
#: data/json/bionics.json data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"The power of the sun, in the palm of my hand!  Installed within you is a "
"perpetual generator powered by nonsensoleum.  When activated its power gen "
"doubles.  If you are seeing this, you'd better be debugging."
msgstr ""

