"designed for actual widespread combat use and was seen on the front lines "
"during the last days of the cataclysm.  Like the heavier suits, it is "
"resistant to most modern weaponry, but it is much more light and "
"maneuverable.  Unfortunately, the world ended before it could roll out in "
"significant numbers.  An integrated chemical resistant bodyglove precludes "
"wearing other clothing, aside from most undergarments or handheld equipment "
"like shields."
msgstr ""

