#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_grunt_classes.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were a senior NCO for the Catastrophe Response and Investigation Team, "
"relaying orders to your squad was an everyday task.  When the cataclysm "
"struck, your expertise helped save everyone time and time again until it all"
" fell apart."
msgstr ""

