#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"Yes.  I ask because I noticed there are dinosaurs around.  Do you know "
"anything about that?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"I know all kinds of weird useless stuff.  I've seen things at churches, I've"
" seen things on farms, I've seen whole exhibits way out.  Those Swampers, "
"they know what's happening.  They're creatures of light come back to save us"
" all.  Or eat us, I forget.  Oh and that Old Guard Repo Man hates them and "
"Red at the train station."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/Mr_Lapin.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/obsolete/npc_dialogue.json
msgid "What can you tell me about the dinosaurs?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid ""
"I am afraid that is drifting far out of my area of expertise, but I would be"
" willing to bet some of the little ones might be worth something to you if "
"you tamed them and raised them.  No fur to speak of, but feathers might be "
"of some use, and meat and eggs could help.  I'm not sure what they eat, but "
"I hope it isn't rabbits or people on the more rabbit adjacent end of things."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Maybe dinosaurs and rabbits aren't so different."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "Swamper"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "The great eaters have returned and they must be fed"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "CEO"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "Bo Baronyx"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "The eaters will be fed."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "Welcome.  Are you hungry friend?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid ""
"You look hungry friend.  So much hunger in this world.  This is the time of "
"the eaters."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "Hello.  Who are the eaters?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "So about the eaters…"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "You mentioned some pretenders before.  What does that mean?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "Is there a way I can help feed the eaters?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "I have to get going.  Take care, CEO Baronyx."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid ""
"The great eaters have returned, along with the false ones.  We must feed the"
" eaters and destroy the pretenders child."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "Who are you talking about?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "No thank you, I'd like to leave now."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid ""
"This Cataclysm has woken the great eaters, lost in time, returned them to "
"the world to do their great work, to multiply and fill the land with their "
"song.  The time of man is over, but we few who remain can do our part to "
"protect this new world from the pretenders, who would steal the meat."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "So what do you do with the meat?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "Who are the great eaters and the pretenders?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "Are there any others left?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid ""
"The great eaters are the ones that were lost, what we call dinosaurs whose "
"meat we took and who are taking it back.  The pretenders are those others "
"that have come to steal the meat of this world.  It does not belong to them "
"and we will take it from their mouths."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "Okay, so you worship dinosaurs.  Understood."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid ""
"The Swampers knew these times would return and we prepared for them.  When "
"others wasted their time and meat, we fed and grew strong, and we filled our"
" stores with meat for this day."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "Yes, very good."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "You keep talking about meat.  Why is meat so important?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid ""
"The meat makes the great eaters strong.  We gather the meat and feed them, "
"and in the end we too will serve the eaters in death as we do in life.  This"
" was always our purpose and we lucky few have lived to see it."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "Our purpose?  How do you know?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid ""
"The return of the great eaters was fortold by a prophet.  We faithful have "
"been waiting and preparing since the revelation."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "I guess it must be nice to be proven right."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "This is crazy."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid ""
"You understand our purpose.  I welcome you to this work, all are needed to "
"feed the eaters."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid ""
"You deny what you see right in front of you.  This world is what was "
"fortold."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "Gather Meat"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Gather Meat'}'
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "Gather meat for Bo Baronyx.  About 8 should do it."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "The eaters are hungry.  They need meat"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid ""
"If you wish to feed the eaters, your work will be rewarded.  Go out, butcher"
" a pure animal.  Not a false eater, the meat must be good to eat.  Then "
"bring me the meat and I will see to the eaters."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "Excellent.  The eaters must feed."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "Understood.  The great eaters will feed either way."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid ""
"Some of the animals have become touched by the pretenders in recent days, "
"larger and more dangerous, producing tainted mutant meat.  This will not "
"work for the great eaters, it must be the true meat."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "Have you brought meat?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "The eaters will feed.  Oh, this one seems to like you."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "The eaters will feed I am sure."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid ""
"I see no meat.  There is meat in the forests and swamps waiting for the "
"eaters."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Nickname for creature 'mon_eoraptor'
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "Bamm-Bamm"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "The eaters have fed.  They will be hungry again in time"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "You know what to do."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "The great eaters must be fed.  Are you ready?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "There is still more work to do.  Are you ready?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "There is meat ready for the feeding.  Are you ready to gather it?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "The eaters are hungry."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "There is more meat needed."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "I know of eaters ready for meat."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "Maybe another time CEO Baronyx."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid ""
"If you are ready to be of service to the great eaters, go and find meat and "
"bring it back.  There is always need for more."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "Happy to be of service to the great eaters.  I'm in."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "Excellent.  Make it happen."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid ""
"The great eaters are not picky, any pure meat will do, but mutant and "
"tainted meat are not good enough."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid ""
"So, meat from a creature that isn't a zombie, or a giant monster.  Got it."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "Of course, you should find everything you need here."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "That explains the knives then."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "Oh, you know my friend Brigitte.  Well in that case, let's go!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "No, I must remain here to oversee the company."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "Of course CEO Baronyx."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "Sweet!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "Not just now.  You should remain here to oversee the company."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid ""
"Of course, the company will be ready when you are and the great eaters will "
"feed either way."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid ""
"It was fortold that as the great eaters returned, so too would the "
"pretenders, who would come to steal the meat.  Very little is asked of us, "
"except that we do all we can to ensure that the true great eaters received "
"as much meat as possible and the pretenders go hungry."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "Yes CEO Baronyx, very good CEO Baronyx."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "This makes no sense and I'm done talking about it."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "Swampers Religious Community and Hotels and Casinos"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Swampers Religious Community and Hotels and Casinos
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid ""
"A prosperous but secretive group of churchgoers and entertainment moguls "
"with an affection for dinosaurs.  They welcome all untainted humans."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
msgid "Red"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
msgid "It's a good day to shoot some dinos."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
msgid ""
"You're back.  I knew you were a killer.  Are you ready to take this country "
"back?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
msgid ""
"You there, wanderer.  You have the look of someone who hates dinosaurs.  Are"
" you ready to take this country back?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
msgid "Dinosaurs?  What are you talking about?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
msgid "So about hunting dinosaurs…"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
msgid "How can I help?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
msgid "Mission update for you, Red."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
msgid "Anyway.  Take care, Red."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
msgid ""
"They just started showing up about the same time it all fell apart.  They "
"attack the caravans and the bandits both.  Hungry bastards.  All dinosaurs "
"are shoot on sight.  We don't eat them, they're probably poisoned with "
"whatever got the dead ones.  Just leave them for the crows.  Same with the "
"eggs."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
msgid "Kill all dinosaurs, interesting…"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
msgid "Probably not important."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
msgid "Secure Area"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Secure Area'}'
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
msgid ""
"We lost another trade caravan.  Whatever did the damage is still out there."
"  Investigate the trade route and eliminate the threat."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
msgid ""
"It sounds like you get it.  There is something out there scaring the "
"merchants.  They got away safe but lost a grain shipment, you're welcome to "
"it if you can haul it back.  Check out the area and report anything you "
"find."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
msgid "Lost in the Woods"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Lost in the Woods'}'
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
msgid ""
"We lost a scout searching the woods for a lost family.  Find the scout or "
"take out what got them."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
msgid ""
"Seems like the only news we get here is bad.  A weirdo family was staying "
"outside the center, I don't know why.  They said something about germs.  "
"Anyway, they're gone, vanished in the night.  We sent a scout out to find "
"them but now they're gone too.  We have a pretty good idea of where in the "
"woods the scout was searching.  Bring back anyone you can alive and end "
"whatever is keeping them."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
msgid ""
"Try not to make too much noise.  Visibility is bad in the woods so it's all "
"about sound."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
msgid "Protect the cattle"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Protect the cattle'}'
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
msgid "Someone or something in the swamps is stealing cattle.  Stop it."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
msgid ""
"This is probably a waste of time, but a nearby farmer has been complaining "
"that someone or something has been stealing a lot of their cattle.  We don't"
" normally bother with little things like this, but our food supplies are "
"getting low and the farmers are threatening to cut us off if we won't help."
"  I've marked on your map where the farmers think the cattle are going."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
msgid ""
"Maybe bring a rope to bring the cattle back or something for them to eat.  "
"They can be ornery cusses if you don't know how to treat them."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
msgid ""
"Oh.  Oh no.  We didn't think the dinosaurs could raise and we've killed so "
"many of them.  We might be in trouble here.  Here's one now, I'll rip it "
"apart!  Wait, I can see in its dead eyes that it loves us and wants to help "
"us.  I'll just end up killing it, I'm barely holding it together here.  "
"You'd better take it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Nickname for creature 'mon_zachycephalosaurus_chain'
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
msgid "Betty"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Kill 50 dinos'}'
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
msgid "Kill 50 dinos"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
msgid ""
"While we were out on a hunting party a couple of those big ugly ones came "
"back and ate a whole mob of the dead I wanted to take out.  We lost a lot of"
" soldiers too while we were out too, good ones, and they died bad.  Slow.  I"
" made sure of it, the traitors.  These dinosaurs have gone too far.  They're"
" making us crazy.  We need to rack up some serious numbers to catch up.  We "
"need some serious risk taking, I'm talking explosives and fire and drugs and"
" rock and roll here.  I don't care if it's living dinos or dead, they all "
"need to be taken down."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
msgid "Kill all dinos."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
msgid "I'm right on the edge soldier.  Whose side are you on here?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
msgid ""
"You can kill a lot of dinos without taking a lot of pills, but I don't see "
"how."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
msgid "You hit your numbers yet?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
msgid ""
"That's what I like to hear.  We got our numbers too, and we chained down a "
"couple too.  I had to take out a few more soldiers who didn't make their "
"numbers, so this is good.  We're doing good."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Nickname for creature 'mon_zachycephalosaurus_chain'
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
msgid "Stromer"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Kill me a T Rex'}'
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
msgid "Kill me a T Rex"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
msgid ""
"I have a special mission I need to complete before these dinos finish "
"killing me off, and I need you to bring me a something special.  Go kill me "
"a T Rex.  We're going to be gods.  It's all going to be worth it."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
msgid "MY LIFE FOR YOU."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
msgid "You're a dino killing machine like me.  You know what to do."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
msgid "You got my body yet?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
msgid ""
"All right, we've got the body here.  Watch this, I'm going to climb into its"
" dead mouth and when you see me again I'll be a god.  *SWALLOW*"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Nickname for creature 'mon_zyrannosaurus_chain'
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
msgid "Wilma"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
msgid "DinoLab survivor"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
msgid "Yoshimi"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
msgid "Need to learn what happened…"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
msgid "How can I help you survivor?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
msgid "Seen any interesting specimens?  I mean dinosaurs."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
msgid ""
"I was just imagining you transforming into a tyrannosaurus rex.  Of course "
"that's impossible.  Unless…"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
msgid "Let's do some science."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
msgid "Please leave me be, I am but a humble muck farmer in this humble muck."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
msgid ""
"You are dressed like a scientist.  Are you a scientist?  You look like a "
"dinosaur.  Are you a dinosaur?  Are you a scientist dinosaur?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
msgid "Die demon mutant!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
msgid "You look like you need help.  Can I do something for you?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
msgid ""
"You have seen through my ruse.  In retrospect I should have prepared a "
"costume of some kind.  Unimportant!  You haven't attacked me or tried to "
"seduce me so you aren't like the others.  Had any bad headaches recently, "
"strange mood swings, strong urges, desire for human flesh?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
msgid "Only the usual.  What are you really?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
msgid "You are aware of the Cataclysm then?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
msgid "I'd rather not say at this point."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
msgid ""
"I am a hard working professional in a challenging field adjusting to a "
"recent change in circumstances.  That is all you need to know."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
msgid ""
"My manager Dr. Tingle made some important mistakes and I have had to make "
"some quick decisions I would rather not go into detail on.  In retrospect "
"our faculties may have been influenced by external factors.  Suffice to say "
"Dr. Tingle is no longer with us but died happy.  And I escaped alive."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
msgid "Look at me.  Yes, I am aware.  The question is what happens next."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
msgid "Yes.  Let's talk about something else."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
msgid ""
"I just got here actually, I've found it wise to move a lot recently.  There "
"may be some interesting specimens nearby.  I mean dinosaurs."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
msgid "First we need some supplies"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
msgid "I think I might know where a decent chemistry set is…"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
msgid ""
"I need a full chemistry set to do my work properly.  I could use some help."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
msgid "So much to do."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
msgid "Fine, you'll probably be dead soon anyway."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
msgid ""
"It might be too dangerous now, any working full chemistry set is fine.  "
"There is a good chance something got out."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
msgid "Do you have the set yet?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
msgid "Let's get started."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
msgid "Very convincing.  I do need an actual chemistry set to work though."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
msgid "It's fine, I'll make something work."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
msgid "Kiernan consult"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
msgid "I need some expert advice…"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
msgid ""
"I don't have access to standard lab procedures here.  Find Dr. Kiernan and "
"get some notes on the basics.  I can work from there."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
msgid "Ugh."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
msgid ""
"Kiernan is probably still at the old field office.  It should be fine as "
"long as the emergency power is still working.  You may have to do some kind "
"of stupid task before Kiernan talks.  Try not to get violent.  If Kiernan is"
" dead try and find some notes or books."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
msgid "Do you have the information yet?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
msgid "Let's get started.  Oh, I'll make you a copy just in case."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
msgid "Very convincing.  I do need the information to work though."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid ""
"Their song is older than ours, but also different.  We have much to learn "
"from their old bones.  I knew a man once who sang not of bones but of meat."
"  If you find him, you will know the face of Bo.  He has listened hardest to"
" them, but I do not know if he hears."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid "That explains everything, thank you."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid ""
"They just started showing up about the same time it all fell apart.  They "
"attack the caravans and the bandits both.  Hungry bastards.  All dinosaurs "
"are shoot on sight.  We don't eat them, they're probably poisoned with "
"whatever got the dead ones.  Just leave them for the crows.  Same with the "
"eggs.  We have a forward base at the train station working on wiping them "
"all out.  Talk to Red there."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Probably for the best."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
msgid ""
"Strange greeting, ignoring that.  What can you tell me about the dinosaurs?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
msgid ""
"Cute things aren't they!  Like big birds with big appetites.  The plant "
"eaters are okay unless they get spooked.  Then it's time to hide on the roof"
" for a while until they calm down.  I gave one some cattle feed and they "
"seemed to like it fine, let me pet it and followed me around some. I bet you"
" could tame them if they're young, maybe even some of the grown ones. A man "
"came out here a while ago saying they were coming, that it was their time "
"and we needed to get with them or get out of the way.  The man said I should"
" follow him to the Swamper church, but I'm too busy here.  A whole lot of "
"people went with him though."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
msgid "I'm sure they're fine.  What was that question again?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgid ""
"That's a lot of meat to break down.  You're going to want to get together a "
"real butcher setup, hooks and all, rig up a way to keep the meat cold or "
"even better frozen, and figure out some way to make it last longer.  Could "
"do jerky, maybe get a canning operation going.  The main thing is to work "
"fast before it goes bad.  Hey, I know a pretty good cook who could help with"
" that.  No, she's dead.  I'm here though."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgid "I'm getting hungry."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/npc_classes_mutant.json
msgid "Stego Mutant"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/npc_classes_mutant.json
msgid "I'm looking for stego mutagen… I'm going to become a thunder lizard."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/npc_classes_mutant.json
msgid "Tyrant Mutant"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/npc_classes_mutant.json
msgid "I'm looking for tyrant mutagen… I'm going to be a king."
msgstr ""

